        "body": "Aircraft Manufacturing is the top market for General Atomics Aeronautical Systems at $524M, followed by Other Support Activities for Air Transportation at $315M and Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing at $228M. Other notable markets include Process, Physical Distribution, and Logistics Consulting Services at $152M and Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing at $68.8M."
